[{"name":"MultiGrid","type":"structure","meta":{"uuid":"5205d121-e860-421a-b40d-64b50d19665c","isGlobalTemplate":false},"configuration":{"columnWidths":[3,9],"layout":{"gap":"L","marginTop":0,"marginBottom":0,"backgroundColor":"transparent"},"visible":true,"columnWidthsTablet":[12,12]},"content":[{"name":"LaccicoKategoriebaum","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"1a17bda9-e8e9-4617-8e14-e559fe4fd1a4","isGlobalTemplate":false},"parent_slot":0,"slot_index":0,"content":{"anzeigen":true}},{"name":"DetailsList","type":"structure","meta":{"uuid":"2043938b-9ecc-4f70-a8b9-a99314f2cba7","isGlobalTemplate":false},"configuration":{"visible":true,"layout":{"fullWidth":false,"caretPosition":"right"}},"content":[{"name":"TextCard","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"549294ef-857e-4344-b949-f37cb54c466e","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"text":{"htmlDescription":"<div class=\"mb-2\"><p class=\"mb-2\"><strong>Sturdy boots in heritage and workwear style suit the 3 mm round lace R3-CS and the 4 mm flat lace F4-CS in orange.</strong></p><p class=\"mb-2\"><br></p><p class=\"mb-2\">Such boots usually have visible eyelets and hooks, which both laces are made for. On dark leather, orange sets a strong accent; the dense cotton braid suits the rustic character of heavy boots.</p><p class=\"mb-2\"><br></p><div class=\"d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center d-md-none bg-light p-2 mb-2 border rounded\"><span class=\"small font-weight-bold text-dark\">&nbsp;<i class=\"fa fa-hand-o-right text-muted mr-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> Boots &amp; orange&nbsp;</span> <span class=\"badge badge-secondary py-1 px-2\">&nbsp;<i class=\"fa fa-arrows-h mr-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> Swipe sideways&nbsp;</span></div></div><div class=\"laccico-scroll-wrapper\"><div class=\"table-responsive laccico-scroll-table\"><table class=\"table table-bordered table-hover text-left mb-0\" style=\"border: 1px solid #000000; font-size: 0.9rem; min-width: 680px;\"><thead class=\"thead-dark\" style=\"background-color: #000000; color: #ffffff;\"><tr><th scope=\"col\" class=\"py-3 px-3\">Shoe</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"py-3 px-3\">Eyelets</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"py-3 px-3\">Series</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"py-3 px-3\">Shade of orange</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"py-3 px-3\">Effect</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class=\"font-weight-bold py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\">Moc-toe boots<br><span class=\"small text-muted font-weight-normal\">Heritage, workwear</span></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Visible eyelets, hooks</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\"><a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/round-laces-by-diameter/round-laces-3-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">R3-CS</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-4-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F4-CS</a></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Orange</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Strong accent on dark leather.</td></tr><tr><td class=\"font-weight-bold py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\">Chukka boots<br><span class=\"small text-muted font-weight-normal\">Suede or smooth leather</span></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Visible eyelets</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\"><a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/round-laces-by-diameter/round-laces-3-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark d-block\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">R3-CS</a></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Orange</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Casual, suits corduroy and tweed.</td></tr><tr><td class=\"font-weight-bold py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\">Lace-up ankle boot<br><span class=\"small text-muted font-weight-normal\">Dark brown leather</span></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Visible eyelets, hooks</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\"><a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-4-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark d-block\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F4-CS</a></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Orange</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Clear, but not loud.</td></tr><tr><td class=\"font-weight-bold py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\">High-top sneakers<br><span class=\"small text-muted font-weight-normal\">In workwear style</span></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Visible eyelets, 5 mm inner diameter or more</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\"><a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-6-mm/f6cs\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark d-block\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F6-CS</a></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Orange</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Fresh, with a sporty touch.</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>","textAlignment":"left","color":""},"button":{"label":"","link":"","variant":"primary"},"layout":{"backgroundColor":"","paddingTop":0,"paddingBottom":0,"paddingLeft":0,"paddingRight":0}},"configuration":{"visible":true,"detailsSettings":{"label":"Which shoelaces suit fashionable heritage and striking workwear styles with orange accents?","defaultOpen":false}}},{"name":"TextCard","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"084dad72-c1bd-461b-9219-6e6d548e6d7d","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"text":{"htmlDescription":"<div class=\"mb-2\"><p class=\"mb-2\"><strong>Orange 3 mm round laces R3-CS or 4 mm flat laces F4-CS. Which of the two fits is decided by the eyelets.</strong></p><p class=\"mb-2\"><br></p><p class=\"mb-2\">The lace should pass easily through the eyelet, otherwise it is put under heavy strain when it is pulled through. On dark leather, orange forms a lively contrast. For low shoes, orange is also available as a 2 mm round lace and a 3 mm flat lace, for sneakers as a 6 mm flat lace.</p><p class=\"mb-2\"><br></p><div class=\"d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center d-md-none bg-light p-2 mb-2 border rounded\"><span class=\"small font-weight-bold text-dark\">&nbsp;<i class=\"fa fa-hand-o-right text-muted mr-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> Orange &amp; leather&nbsp;</span> <span class=\"badge badge-secondary py-1 px-2\">&nbsp;<i class=\"fa fa-arrows-h mr-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> Swipe sideways&nbsp;</span></div></div><div class=\"laccico-scroll-wrapper\"><div class=\"table-responsive laccico-scroll-table\"><table class=\"table table-bordered table-hover text-left mb-0\" style=\"border: 1px solid #000000; font-size: 0.9rem; min-width: 560px;\"><thead class=\"thead-dark\" style=\"background-color: #000000; color: #ffffff;\"><tr><th scope=\"col\" class=\"py-3 px-3\">Shoe</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"py-3 px-3\">Shade of orange</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"py-3 px-3\">Series</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"py-3 px-3\">Effect</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class=\"font-weight-bold py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\">Dark brown boots<br><span class=\"small text-muted font-weight-normal\">Smooth leather or suede</span></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Orange</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\"><a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/round-laces-by-diameter/round-laces-3-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">R3-CS</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-4-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F4-CS</a></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Warm, strong contrast.</td></tr><tr><td class=\"font-weight-bold py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\">Black boots<br><span class=\"small text-muted font-weight-normal\">Smooth leather</span></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Orange</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\"><a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-4-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark d-block\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F4-CS</a></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Strong contrast.</td></tr><tr><td class=\"font-weight-bold py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\">Derbies, brogues<br><span class=\"small text-muted font-weight-normal\">Brown or blue suede</span></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Orange, Orange Juice · R2-SL: Arancione (orange)</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\"><a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/round-laces-by-diameter/round-laces-2-mm/r2-cs\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">R2-CS</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/round-laces-by-diameter/round-laces-2-mm/r2-sl\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">R2-SL</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-3-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F3-CS</a></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Fresh splash of colour.</td></tr><tr><td class=\"font-weight-bold py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\">Light sneakers<br><span class=\"small text-muted font-weight-normal\">White or light grey</span></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Orange</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\"><a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-6-mm/f6cs\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark d-block\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F6-CS</a></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Fresh and cheerful.</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>","textAlignment":"left","color":""},"button":{"label":"","link":"","variant":"primary"},"layout":{"backgroundColor":"","paddingTop":0,"paddingBottom":0,"paddingLeft":0,"paddingRight":0}},"configuration":{"visible":true,"detailsSettings":{"label":"Which shoelaces do you choose as a striking signal accent for casual boots?","defaultOpen":false}}},{"name":"TextCard","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"be568fdb-4b89-4bbd-8c92-4ec19107f54e","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"text":{"htmlDescription":"<div class=\"mb-2\"><p class=\"mb-2\"><strong>The dyeing is done by the yarn manufacturers. They dye the cotton yarns with special dyeing and fixing processes before the laces are braided from them.</strong></p><p class=\"mb-2\"><br></p><p class=\"mb-2\">The wax does not bind the colour, but it forms a protective barrier: it penetrates the fibre structure of the braid. With normal wear, the laces stay colourfast for a long time thanks to good dyeing. If a lace looks dull over time, pull it firmly through a soft cotton cloth and the sheen comes back.</p><p class=\"mb-2\"><br></p><div class=\"d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center d-md-none bg-light p-2 mb-2 border rounded\"><span class=\"small font-weight-bold text-dark\">&nbsp;<i class=\"fa fa-hand-o-right text-muted mr-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> Colour &amp; wax&nbsp;</span> <span class=\"badge badge-secondary py-1 px-2\">&nbsp;<i class=\"fa fa-arrows-h mr-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> Swipe sideways&nbsp;</span></div></div><div class=\"laccico-scroll-wrapper\"><div class=\"table-responsive laccico-scroll-table\"><table class=\"table table-bordered table-hover text-left mb-0\" style=\"border: 1px solid #000000; font-size: 0.9rem; min-width: 560px;\"><thead class=\"thead-dark\" style=\"background-color: #000000; color: #ffffff;\"><tr><th scope=\"col\" class=\"py-3 px-3\">Step</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"py-3 px-3\">What happens</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"py-3 px-3\">What it does</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"py-3 px-3\">Series</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class=\"font-weight-bold py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\">Dyeing<br><span class=\"small text-muted font-weight-normal\">Yarn</span></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">The yarn manufacturers dye and fix the cotton yarns.</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Even colour along the whole length.</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\"><a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/round-laces-by-diameter/round-laces-2-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">R2</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/round-laces-by-diameter/round-laces-3-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">R3</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-3-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F3</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-4-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F4</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-6-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F6</a></td></tr><tr><td class=\"font-weight-bold py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\">Waxing<br><span class=\"small text-muted font-weight-normal\">Finish</span></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Waxed, hot-rolled and polished. The wax penetrates the fibre structure.</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Protective barrier, silky-matt sheen.</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\"><a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/round-laces-by-diameter/round-laces-2-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">R2</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/round-laces-by-diameter/round-laces-3-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">R3</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-3-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F3</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-4-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F4</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-6-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F6</a></td></tr><tr><td class=\"font-weight-bold py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\">Refreshing<br><span class=\"small text-muted font-weight-normal\">Cotton cloth</span></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Hold the lace firmly and pull it through firmly.</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">The wax is redistributed and the sheen comes back.</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\"><a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/round-laces-by-diameter/round-laces-2-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">R2</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/round-laces-by-diameter/round-laces-3-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">R3</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-3-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F3</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-4-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F4</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-6-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F6</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>","textAlignment":"left","color":""},"button":{"label":"","link":"","variant":"primary"},"layout":{"backgroundColor":"","paddingTop":0,"paddingBottom":0,"paddingLeft":0,"paddingRight":0}},"configuration":{"visible":true,"detailsSettings":{"label":"How do orange waxed shoelaces keep their colour?","defaultOpen":false}}},{"name":"TextCard","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"58d14e02-8db4-4a65-8f8d-a61a55ff6a3c","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"text":{"htmlDescription":"<div class=\"mb-2\"><p class=\"mb-2\"><strong>Densely braided, waxed cotton laces. They hardly stretch and keep their shape even when soaked.</strong></p><p class=\"mb-2\"><br></p><p class=\"mb-2\">The number of bobbins and the yarn thickness are matched to each lace during braiding. The wax penetrates the fibre structure and protects against moisture. One advantage shows in the rain: the bow of a waxed cotton lace does not come undone as easily.</p><p class=\"mb-2\"><br></p><div class=\"d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center d-md-none bg-light p-2 mb-2 border rounded\"><span class=\"small font-weight-bold text-dark\">&nbsp;<i class=\"fa fa-hand-o-right text-muted mr-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> Wet weather &amp; shape&nbsp;</span> <span class=\"badge badge-secondary py-1 px-2\">&nbsp;<i class=\"fa fa-arrows-h mr-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> Swipe sideways&nbsp;</span></div></div><div class=\"laccico-scroll-wrapper\"><div class=\"table-responsive laccico-scroll-table\"><table class=\"table table-bordered table-hover text-left mb-0\" style=\"border: 1px solid #000000; font-size: 0.9rem; min-width: 560px;\"><thead class=\"thead-dark\" style=\"background-color: #000000; color: #ffffff;\"><tr><th scope=\"col\" class=\"py-3 px-3\">Feature</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"py-3 px-3\">Construction</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"py-3 px-3\">What it does</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"py-3 px-3\">Series</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class=\"font-weight-bold py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\">Braiding<br><span class=\"small text-muted font-weight-normal\">Dense and tight</span></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Number of bobbins and yarn thickness to suit the lace.</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Hardly stretches, does not stretch out.</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\"><a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/round-laces-by-diameter/round-laces-2-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">R2</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/round-laces-by-diameter/round-laces-3-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">R3</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-3-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F3</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-4-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F4</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-6-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F6</a></td></tr><tr><td class=\"font-weight-bold py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\">Wet weather<br><span class=\"small text-muted font-weight-normal\">Rain, snow</span></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Tightly braided from 100 % cotton.</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Keeps its shape even when soaked.</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\"><a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/round-laces-by-diameter/round-laces-2-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">R2</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/round-laces-by-diameter/round-laces-3-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">R3</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-3-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F3</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-4-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F4</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-6-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F6</a></td></tr><tr><td class=\"font-weight-bold py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\">Waxing<br><span class=\"small text-muted font-weight-normal\">Finish</span></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Waxed, hot-rolled and polished.</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Protects against moisture and abrasion.</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\"><a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/round-laces-by-diameter/round-laces-2-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">R2</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/round-laces-by-diameter/round-laces-3-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">R3</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-3-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F3</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-4-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F4</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-6-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F6</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>","textAlignment":"left","color":""},"button":{"label":"","link":"","variant":"primary"},"layout":{"backgroundColor":"","paddingTop":0,"paddingBottom":0,"paddingLeft":0,"paddingRight":0}},"configuration":{"visible":true,"detailsSettings":{"label":"Which shoelaces keep their shape even when very wet?","defaultOpen":false}}},{"name":"TextCard","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"b9d90df8-09aa-4ede-9cb7-284450b9b9be","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"text":{"htmlDescription":"<div class=\"mb-2\"><p class=\"mb-2\"><strong>A lace becomes tear-resistant through good yarn and dense, tight braiding. The colour plays no part in this.</strong></p><p class=\"mb-2\"><br></p><p class=\"mb-2\">LACCICO shoelaces are made of 100 % cotton, densely braided and waxed. The wax protects them against abrasion. If a lace still breaks early, it is usually due to an eyelet with burrs or to pulling in the wrong direction on hooks.</p><p class=\"mb-2\"><br></p><div class=\"d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center d-md-none bg-light p-2 mb-2 border rounded\"><span class=\"small font-weight-bold text-dark\">&nbsp;<i class=\"fa fa-hand-o-right text-muted mr-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> Construction &amp; tear resistance&nbsp;</span> <span class=\"badge badge-secondary py-1 px-2\">&nbsp;<i class=\"fa fa-arrows-h mr-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> Swipe sideways&nbsp;</span></div></div><div class=\"laccico-scroll-wrapper\"><div class=\"table-responsive laccico-scroll-table\"><table class=\"table table-bordered table-hover text-left mb-0\" style=\"border: 1px solid #000000; font-size: 0.9rem; min-width: 560px;\"><thead class=\"thead-dark\" style=\"background-color: #000000; color: #ffffff;\"><tr><th scope=\"col\" class=\"py-3 px-3\">Feature</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"py-3 px-3\">Construction</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"py-3 px-3\">What it does</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"py-3 px-3\">Series</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class=\"font-weight-bold py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\">Yarn<br><span class=\"small text-muted font-weight-normal\">Cotton</span></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">100 % cotton.</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Tear-resistant.</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\"><a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/round-laces-by-diameter/round-laces-2-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">R2</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/round-laces-by-diameter/round-laces-3-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">R3</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-3-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F3</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-4-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F4</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-6-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F6</a></td></tr><tr><td class=\"font-weight-bold py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\">Braiding<br><span class=\"small text-muted font-weight-normal\">Dense and tight</span></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Number of bobbins and yarn thickness to suit the lace.</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Tear-resistant, does not stretch out.</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\"><a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/round-laces-by-diameter/round-laces-2-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">R2</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/round-laces-by-diameter/round-laces-3-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">R3</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-3-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F3</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-4-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F4</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-6-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F6</a></td></tr><tr><td class=\"font-weight-bold py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\">Waxing<br><span class=\"small text-muted font-weight-normal\">Finish</span></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">The wax penetrates the fibre structure.</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Protects against abrasion at the eyelet.</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\"><a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/round-laces-by-diameter/round-laces-2-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">R2</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/round-laces-by-diameter/round-laces-3-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">R3</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-3-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F3</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-4-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F4</a> · <a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/flat-laces-by-width/flat-laces-6-mm\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F6</a></td></tr><tr><td class=\"font-weight-bold py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\">Eyelet<br><span class=\"small text-muted font-weight-normal\">Right size</span></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">The lace passes easily through the eyelet.</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Not put under unnecessary strain when pulled through.</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\"><a href=\"/en/shape-diameter/round-laces-by-diameter/round-laces-2-mm\"